ananicy-rs (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging.
    - Built from the project's own cargo build with its default feature set
      (netlink process events plus systemd integration), installed through
      `make install` so the binary, its mode and the shipped systemd unit match
      every other recipe under contrib/.
    - Cargo dependencies are vendored into debian/vendor.tar.xz and the build
      runs with --locked --offline and a CARGO_HOME inside the build directory,
      so dpkg-buildpackage needs no network access.
    - Ships no rules. ananicy-rs reads /etc/ananicy.d and writes a default
      ananicy.conf there on first start; both are left unowned so upgrades never
      touch an administrator's configuration.

 -- ananicy-rs packagers <ananicy-rs-packaging@example.invalid>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
